OL,3,AFaisal Islam: This cost-cutting UK-EU  
OL,4,Adeal doesn't mean lower prices will    
OL,5,Afollow                                 
OL,7,FThe prime minister made a lot of the   
OL,8,FUK's new deal with the EU cutting costs
OL,9,Ffor business and consumers during tough
OL,10,Ftimes.                                 
OL,12,FIn another world, Andy Burnham would   
OL,13,Fhave loved for the nation's            
OL,14,Fsupermarkets to clearly announce that  
OL,15,Fthey could cut food prices as a result 
OL,16,Fof this latest agreement on food       
OL,17,Fexports.                               
OL,19,FAnd while grocers have very much       
OL,20,Fwelcomed Friday's announcement, they   
OL,21,Fhave notably not committed to price    
OL,22,Fcuts as a direct result of this move.  
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
