OL,3,AFaisal Islam: This cost-cutting UK-EU  
OL,4,Adeal doesn't mean lower prices will    
OL,5,Afollow                                 
OL,7,FThe managing director of M&S, Alex     
OL,8,FFreudmann, called the deal a "major    
OL,9,Fstep forward", saying it would remove  
OL,10,Fbureaucracy. Tesco chief executive Ken 
OL,11,FMurphy added it was "good news for     
OL,12,FBritish farmers and producers".        
